port.\\n\",\"number\":24,\"state\":\"MERGED\",\"title\":\"Restore cledger maintenance command behavior\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-25T13:07:25Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/evintunador/conversation-ledger/pull/24\"},{\"body\":\"## Summary\\nExport cledger's existing `asLedger` factory and `CLEDGER_NAMESPACE` descriptor from its public package entrypoint. This lets downstream CLIs use the exact namespace owner configuration when routing shared records maintenance through annals.\\n\\n## Verification\\n- `npm test` (105 passed)\\n- `npm run build`\\n\\nNo namespace fields, hooks, or transport behavior change.\\n\",\"number\":23,\"state\":\"MERGED\",\"title\":\"Export cledger Ledger factory for downstream records CLIs\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-25T02:43:36Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/evintunador/conversation-ledger/pull/23\"},{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n- Route canonical `cledger records` maintenance commands and retained top-level aliases through annals `runRecordsCommand` with the existing cledger ledger, streams, environment, and command name.\\n- Preserve the exact namespace descriptor and installed `transport-push` hook behavior, including fail-open errors and strict scan blocking.\\n- Document command syntax, exit codes, human-only actions, and the complete standalone annals profile; bump the package to 0.27.0.\\n\\n## Verification\\n- `npm test` — 104 passed.\\n- `node --test dist/test/cli-records.test.js` — 4 passed after adding the strict hook case.\\n- `node dist/cli.js scan` — no findings.\\n- `git diff --check` — clean.\\n\\n## Review notes\\n- The annals dispatcher now owns sync/review/inspect/redact/allow/reanchor syntax. The top-level aliases take that same syntax; the README documents it.\\n- Agent-session refusals are tested with `CODEX_SANDBOX` set; no human-only remediation workflow was executed.\\n\",\"number\":22,\"state\":\"MERGED\",\"title\":\"Add canonical records commands via annals dispatcher\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-25T02:31:14Z\",\"url\":\"