te\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"Expand installed CLI/TUI conformance matrix and fix Qwen image result retention\"}\n{\"mergeCommit\":{\"oid\":\"f9853f7b38ee1fefdb587748055a18e240efb48c\"},\"mergedAt\":\"2026-10-05T20:16:48Z\",\"state\":\"MERGED\"}\n","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 35 --repo evintunador/conversation-ledger --json title,body,state,files; gh pr view 26 --repo evintunador/conversation-ledger --json state,mergedAt,mergeCommit"],"cwd":"file:///Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","duration":{"nanos":627156750,"secs":1},"exit_code":0,"formatted_output":"{\"body\":\"## Scope\\n\\nTracks #27 across all 20 supported CLIs, headless and native TUI, macOS and Linux, at pinned versions. Eight selected scripted cases are separate from local DeepSeek and usual-provider canaries. This PR remains a draft; #27 is open.\\n\\n## Changes\\n\\n- Generate a readable support matrix from version/mode/OS-specific installed evidence, retaining failures and observed upstream limitations.\\n- Add installed drivers for seventeen CLIs in both modes, plus Cursor in both modes, with synthetic repos/configs and automatic ledger observations before two idempotent backfills.\\n- Preserve real Cursor tool IDs and convert binary Read output into references in normalized and raw evidence. Native TUI hooks omit binary bodies; keep that omission explicit without fabricated empty-file hashes or zero-byte sizes.\\n- Repair Qwen 0.24.6 image tool-result retention: `functionResponse.parts` was discarded when it lived alongside `response`.\\n- Add actual image-entry classification regressions and native input/lifecycle handling for the pinned interfaces.\\n- Add OpenCode and Pi canary runners that exit, resume the native session, read a newly randomized value and check automatic linked evidence before both backfills. CI tests the runner with scripted replies; these are not real-model passes.\\n- Record Kiro headless usual-provider authentication as subscription-only/contributor-blocked. Droid isolated resume authentication remains pending. Cursor now has a reproducible headless RPC conformance driver with read/error/image/checkpoint/resume proof. Its CLI and TUI now pass on macOS and Linux CI, with observed native image-entry/binary-hook limitations.\\n- Split additional attachment/lifecycle features into #28–#34.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\n- Full seventeen-CLI CI run: 34/34 macOS scenarios passed and 32/34 Linux scenarios passed. Linux Cline headless exits before any model request; Vibe TUI resume stalled. The next Linux run passed 33/34 scenarios: Vibe is repaired, and Cline headless remains failed. That run stopped macOS at a PTY timing regression before native verification; the timing assertion is repaired. The latest full gate passes 35/35 macOS and 34/35 Linux scenarios, including Cursor headless. Cline headless remains failed on Linux. Later local Cline failures also replace earlier case passes.\\n- Initial nine-CLI CI run: all 18 macOS scenarios passed; 17/18 Linux scenarios passed. Gemini TUI backfill failed and remains visible.\\n- Expanded sixteen-CLI CI run: 29/32 scenarios passed on each OS. Failures and backfill diagnostics are retained. Follow-up fixes cover Kilo snapshot startup, Cline native image entry, Open Interpreter exit timing, and narrowly identified unused Gemini bootstrap records. The focused six-CLI rerun passed all 12 scenarios on each OS, including Aider. A fresh full native gate is queued for the latest fixes.\\n- Latest persistent-workspace suite: 437 tests, 381 passed, zero failures, 56 opt-in skips.\\n- Cursor headless and native TUI pass on both CI operating systems. Native TUI passes normal exit/resume and two unchanged backfills (17/17/17 automatic records), with observed image entry and binary-hook limitations.\\n- Installed OpenCode and Pi canary-driver tests: both modes passed against a free scripted loopback substitute, including a fresh read after resume.\\n\\n## Still required\\n\\n- Resolve Cline native headless startup and obtain a green full native gate. Vibe TUI resume now passes on Linux.\\n- Complete Kiro conformance and resolve isolated Droid authentication paths.\\n- Implement remaining canary drivers and run real models on both OSes/modes.\\n- Local inference is deferred until power/cooling are ready. A persistent shared $20 campaign ceiling now reserves worst-case costs before forwarding requests and survives restarts; budget regressions pass. Paid execution still awaits funded provider selection, reviewed prices and an external durable authority. API usage so far: $0.\\n\\n[Support matrix](https://github.com/evintunador/conversation-ledger/blob/codex/issue-27-installed-conformance/docs/SUPPORT_MATRIX.md) · [Reproduction and scope](https://github.com/evintunador/conversation-ledger/blob/codex/issue-27-installed-conformance/docs/CORE_CONFORMANCE.md)\\n\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\".github/workflows/native-verification.yml\",\"additions\":39,\"deletions\":10,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/BUDGETED_LIVE_VERIFICATION.md\",\"additions\":55,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/CLI_RECORD_COVERAGE.md\",\"additions\":8,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/CORE_CONFORMANCE.md\",\"additions\":196,\"deletions\":23,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/NATIVE_RUNTIME_PROVISIONING.md\",\"additions\":10,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/SUPPORT_MATRIX.json\",\"additions\":5774,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/SUPPORT_MATRIX.md\",\"additions\":162,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/verification-evidence/canary-kiro-headless-darwin-subscription-blocked-2026-10-05.json\",\"additions\":20,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/verification-evidence/canary-kiro-headless-linux-subscription-blocked-2026-10-05.json\",\"additions\":20,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/verification-eviden